Author: Michael Dougherty [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michael Dougherty <Michael.P.Dougherty@usace.army.mil>
Description: Tools for creating, migrating, and validating durable repository
  context for reproducible AI-assisted development. A versioned scaffold routes
  standing agent instructions through 'AGENTS.md' into maintained goals,
  architecture, decisions, governance, workflows, schemas, features, and concise
  checkpoints. Structured migration plans preserve legacy content until an
  explicitly approved application has created and validated its replacement.
